+config MEMORIA_KEEP_AWAKE
+    bool "Memoria keep-awake test build: leave chip deep sleep off"
+    depends on BOARD_TYPE_MEMORIA_ESP_VOCAT
+    default n
+    help
+        Park in wifi hold instead of calling esp_deep_sleep_start, so USB serial stays
+        enumerated on a remote test device. The microphone stays closed until a screen
+        tap or the USB `wake` line. Product and bench images leave this off. Enable it
+        only with build.sh --keep-awake (config.keep-awake.json). The firmware publisher
+        refuses the image.
+
